    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explanation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a JRPG set on an alien planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about a star in another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A planet whose environment and ecology are different from our world. Living things live peacefully and in harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, something strange suddenly occurred on that planet. A mysterious disease spread, people have suddenly turned into monsters, and peaceful days were threatened. <br>Will the main characters, the birds, be able to solve the case?   <br>Experience the story of this planet with them while enjoying relaxing battles and mini-games. <br> <br>Battle <br>It's a classic turn-based battle. After setting it up, you can relax and watch the battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini game<br>It's a rustic yet heartwarming Mini-game. <br>Press the switch to start the game. (Some games start without pressing the switch.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bGame engine<br>Produced with SmileGameBuilder and RPGDeveloperBakin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bTrailers and screenshots are from the base application.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explanation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a JRPG set on an alien planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about a star in another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A planet whose environment and ecology are different from our world. Living things live peacefully and in harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, something strange suddenly occurred on that planet. A mysterious disease spread, people have suddenly turned into monsters, and peaceful days were threatened. <br>Will the main characters, the birds, be able to solve the case?   <br>Experience the story of this planet with them while enjoying relaxing battles and mini-games. <br> <br>Battle <br>It's a classic turn-based battle. After setting it up, you can relax and watch the battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini game<br>It's a rustic yet heartwarming Mini-game. <br>Press the switch to start the game. (Some games start without pressing the switch.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bGame engine<br>Produced with SmileGameBuilder and RPGDeveloperBakin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bTrailers and screenshots are from the base application.</p>",
